                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If you have photosensitivity issues, such as migraines and seizures, you may want to be cautious when playing this game. The lights, textures, and movement can cause problems. Personally, I got a migraine every time I tried to play, and other games of this type (Portal 2 immediately comes to mind due to the similar mechanics, and Dead Space due to the style) don't cause that sort of reaction.\n\nThe concept is fun, and as a puzzle game, it's definitely good. Just use caution if you're susceptible to headaches and the like.",
